  "title": "At ASH 2025 Oral Presentation, Immix Biopharma Reports Positive Phase 2 NXC-201 Results, Advancing Toward BLA Submission as a Potentially First- and Best-in-Class Therapy for relapsed/refractory AL Amyloidosis",
